window.products.push({"id":729109,"name":"Topeakmart Accent Storage Cabinet, Buffet Cabinet with 2 Sliding Doors Adjustable Shelf, Stackable, Sideboard with Storage for Entryway Living Room Us","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":94.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71StnW-b2zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Easy-to-slide doors】Our sliding storage cabinet is built with 2 doors running on smooth plastic roller wheels. Unlike the pull-and-push hinge door pattern, this sliding style does well in space saving and thus is great for small rooms. Also it provides you with an easy access to the stored items. In spite of missing door handles, you can take advantage of the door face carvings for convenient handling as well as simple decoration. 【Adjustable shelf】Inside this buffet cabinet is a height-adjustable storage shelf. With such a shelf, you can manage to make the top storage space high within a range from 22cm/8.7\" to 32cm/12.6\". The adjustment fittings come along in the package for your convenience. Follow the instruction manual, you'll find it easy to adjust the shelf to your variable needs. 【Sleek and practical design】This contemporary TV cabinet has a minimalist look, which will go well with a variety of home decor. A pure color makes room matching easy. Simple face carving lines serve both functional and aesthetic purposes. 【Standard fitting measurements】By and large, it measures 107cm/42\" in width, 33cm/13\" in depth and 63cm/25\" in height. Measure your intended place and see if these fit. Its net weight is 20.5kg/45.2lb while the gross weight is 23.4kg/51.6lb. A little bit heavy only due to the solid materials we apply. 【Easy assembly】We have an easy-to-read assembly instruction manual attached to each package of this wall cabinet. You can get an equivalent digital manual as well via the QR code there. In addition, our customer service team will assist you with your inquiries about the installation and stuff. Kindly note that besides our backups you might still want to have more hands with the assembly for work efficiency.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71StnW-b2zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Topeakmart","source_asin":"B0BS2LV9ZW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-729109","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS2LV9ZW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS2LV9ZW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
