window.products.push({"id":729143,"name":"ApexDesk AXB6030-WHT Elite Series Electric Height Adjustable Standing Desk, 60\", White Top, White Frame - Bundle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":729.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MunLJ1tvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Apex Desk Elite Series Height Adjustable Desk distinguishes itself in many ways and is a big bang for your hard-earned buck: ➢ Stability – The underframe is constructed with one-piece center beam for added stability. It is more stable than many desks that have a crossbar. ➢ Crossbar-Free – It allows more leg room and flexibility of adding an exercise bike/treadmill by some users. ➢ Ease of Assembly – Most users get it up and running in less than 45 minutes, thanks to the screw-less design that uses levers rather than screws to secure beam to the lifting columns. ➢ MDF Desktop – Most desks in our price range are constructed with low-grade particle board. Ours is made of MDF medium density fiberboard with anti-scratch, high-pressure laminate – a premium material used primarily in high-end furniture. Featuring European design and engineering, the Elite Series Electric Height Adjustable Desk lets you transform seamlessly from a sitting to a standing position within a matter of seconds with a push of a button. Bundle Includes ApexDesk 3-Drawer Metal Mobile File Cabinet with Locking Keys Sturdy and Durable – This steel-constructed 3-drawer filing cabinet has a sleek and modern feel, with round edges and smooth matte finish. Its compact design allows this drawer to fit under most office desks. Spacious Storage – 2 upper drawers with one stationery tray to provide storage space for your small office essentials. Outer dims for each drawer is 13.6W x 17.7D x 5.1H. Overall Dimensions: 18.8 L x 15.3 W x 23.2 H. Versatile Bottom Drawer – Bottom-hanging file drawer comes with one removable hanging bar to accommodate different file sizes - Letter, A4 and Legal. Bottom drawer outer dims 12.8W x 17.7D x 9.4H. Anti-Tilt Mechanism – Allows only one drawer to open at a time, preventing the cabinet from tipping over. 360° Swivel Casters – Easily moves across your room without damaging your floor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MunLJ1tvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ApexDesk","source_asin":"B083QSXFSM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-729143","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083QSXFSM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083QSXFSM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":729144,"name":"Backyard Bum EXTRA LARGE 20 ounce Premium Coffee Mugs for Men and Women | Double Wall, 20 oz. Insulated Mugs, Set of 2 | Latte, Tea, Cappuccino | Clea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Evh6h3XVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★ SIMPLY THE BIGGEST & BEST DOUBLE WALL MUGS ON THE MARKET! We REDESIGNED VERSION 2 after years of field testing and they are better than ever! Double Walled (set of 2), hold 20 OUNCES and are a perfect for Keurig or pour over. *HAND MADE! Each mug is made from the highest quality borosilicate glass (the same material used by PYREX), properly packed 'n sealed. *IMPORTANT: WE DO NOT RECOMMEND THE USE OF MICROWAVES OR DISHWASHERS, since each mug is hand blown. Follow recommendations for longevity. ★ KEEP YOUR HOT DRINKS HOT & COLD DRINKS COLD: If you LOVE coffee and tea, our mugs are FOR YOU. The DOUBLE WALL INSULATION can be used for hot or cold beverages (iced or hot coffee tea, smoothies etc.). Cuddle up! They keep your hot drinks hotter while cool to the touch - NO burning fingers! There is ZERO condensation from cold drinks—NO MORE COASTERS. Mugs are 5 in. high, 4 in. top diameter. If your mugs arrive damaged at all due to shipping, PLEASE REACH OUT TO US DIRECTLY by email for help! ★ BONUS EBOOK INCLUDED & MUGS FOR ANY OCCASION: A Baker’s Dozen Recipes & Tips Ebook for Backyard Bum customers ONLY! Order your coffee mugs NOW and receive an email with your EBook download of delicious recipes, tips and suggestions. So, check your inbox. Your joy is ours! They make a GREAT GIFT for BIRTHDAY, WEDDING, CHRISTMAS, HOUSEWARMING and everything in between. You and your family will love them! ★ TOXIN FREE & NO STAINS: Unlike ceramic mugs, this special type of glass does not stain over time. Our 100% borosilicate glass mugs are completely free of plastics or any other toxic materials and will be your BEST mug! ★ SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - LOVE THEM OR YOUR MONEY BACK: You’ll love our glasses, we’ll even guarantee it— if you’re not satisfied within 30 days of purchase just let us know and we’ll take care of it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Evh6h3XVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Backyard Bum","source_asin":"B0789WNLHC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-729144","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0789WNLHC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0789WNLHC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
