window.products.push({"id":729218,"name":"Unbreakable Tea Cup,500ml/17oz Tea Mug,Glass Tea Cup with Infuser and Lid,Tea Infuser Mug for Blooming Tea,Loose Leaf Tea,Tea Bag,Tea Cup Set (17oz)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SqhnszjBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【☕WHY CHOOSE OUR TEA CUP】: Our tea cup, the overall appearance is round and full, and it is equipped with an infuser and a lid, which is more practical in combination. The larger capacity can meet your different tea drinking needs. At the same time, the material of glass is easy to clean and convenient for daily use. 【☕QUALITY UPGRADE】: The tea infuser mug is made of thick borosilicate glass, which can withstand sudden changes in hot and cold temperatures without bursting. This kind of glass does not contain lead, heavy metals and toxins, and is more environmentally friendly and healthy. At the same time, it can also be heated in a microwave oven and an electric stove tops, which is very convenient. 【☕FUNCTIONAL DETAIL DESIGN】: Our tea cup with infuser and lid has a round and cute overall shape. Glass infuser with fine mesh, which can effectively filter tea leaves. The design of the flat lid can be used to place the infuser. When you need to drink the tea, you can take the infuser out and place it on the lid, which is hygienic and prevents water from soaking your table. Thickened handle for comfortable grip. It is a convenient and practical glass tea cup. 【☕SIZE & CAPACITY】: Glass Infusion Mug，Size: Caliber: 3in, Height: 4.6in, Bottom Diameter: 2.1in. Capacity: 500ml/17oz. This large tea mug is perfect for making flowering tea, loose leaf tea, tea bags and more. At the same time, it can also be used as a coffee mug, you can take out the infuser to use the mug alone, it can be suitable for all your favorite drinks such as coffee, milk, juice, etc. It is widely used. 【☕IDEAL CHOICE】: Our tea cup set is perfect for your family, friends, lover and tea lovers. Hope to bring you peace and warmth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SqhnszjBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Unbreakable","source_asin":"B0C26YYT4S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-729218","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C26YYT4S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C26YYT4S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
