window.products.push({"id":729340,"name":"Mr. Coffee Electric 2-2/7-Ounce Coffee Grinder, Chrome","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41sRBUfwaUL._AC_.jpg","description":"Sleek and sophisticated, this electric 2-2/7-ounce coffee grinder not only looks good in any modern kitchen, but it also makes quick work of grinding whole coffee beans into freshly ground coffee ready for brewing. Simply add a measured amount of beans to the stainless-steel grinding chamber, position the transparent cover securely in place, and press down on the on/off safety switch to set the blades spinning (won't operate with improper placement of lid). The chamber's round shape helps ensure consistent grinding, and its generous interior can accommodate enough beans for up to 12 cups of coffee. By flipping the unit upside down, the large lid can be used to transfer the ground coffee from the grinder to a coffeemaker. With rubber feet for stability, the coffee grinder measures 4-2/7 by 4-2/7 by 7-3/5 inches and carries a one-year limited warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41sRBUfwaUL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mr. Coffee","source_asin":"B00005OTYH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-729340","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005OTYH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005OTYH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
