window.products.push({"id":729458,"name":"Reusable Shopping Bags Reinforced Bottom - Set of 6pcs (Black) - 4 Washable Large Reusable Bags for Shopping (Hold 55 lbs) + 2 Neoprene Bag Handle Wra","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IrDBvg3WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our heavy duty large reusable shopping bags has popular wide base design, but unlike other bags has removable stiffener placed at the bottom of the bag. Reinforced with extra intricate handles sewn into the entire face of the bag which makes this tote with handle more durable. As a bonus, package included neoprene handle wraps in the kit to make carrying of grocery bags more convenient and comfortable for your hands. Main features: : - Extra large grocery bag has such sizes: 10.2”L x 16.1”W x 13” (26 cm x 40.6 cm x 33 cm).  - Bags material: 120gsm polypropylene non woven in black color. - These shopping bags for groceries are foldable, which means that they do not take up much space. - Our foldable extra large grocery tote bags are great for grocery shopping, picnics, laundry, the beach, travel and more.  - These grocery bags washable. This significantly saves money on disposable bags and also keeps the environment clean.  - Such a set of large grocery shopping bags will allow you to buy everything you need in one trip!  - Includes BONUS: soft and comfort handle cover wrap!  - The set comes with 2 handles at once.  - Handle wrap made of neoprene material with slight elastic.  - Velcro handle has strength and elasticity, withstands impacts, scratches, and jerks.  - One solid black color.  - Size of shopping handle wraps is 4.33” x 5.11” (11 cm x 13 cm).  Reusable bags with plastic bottom allows you to carry heavier products, while it’s more convenient and practical than using a regular bag that will bend and look ridiculous. These reusable shopping bags heavy duty are eco-friendly, they can be used for much more than lugging groceries as they are great for laundry, storing household items, and for use at concerts, picnics or the beach. Order now our large reusable bags set with BONUS handle grips and make your shopping trip easier and the environment cleaner!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IrDBvg3WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TISI BAG","source_asin":"B088F43DY7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-729458","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088F43DY7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088F43DY7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
