window.products.push({"id":729460,"name":"Hysenm Blacklight Tapestry for Bedroom Aesthetic Trippy Tapestry Hippie Room Decor, UV Reactive Black Light Fantasy Wall Tapestry for Bedroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vg1xmwNOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Blacklight/UV Reactive】 With special ink and advanced sublimation printing technology, the blacklight tapestry can glow gorgeously under blacklight or UV light in the dark. The trippy room decor looks cool and colorful not only under black light or UV light, but also under LED light and neon. 【Decent Quality】 Made of high-quality polyester, this misty forest tapestries are very lightweight, soft, and durable. It is easy to hang and install, making it a great addition to your room decor. 【Multipurpose】 This wall tapestry is not only a beautiful home decor item, but it can also be used as space party decorations backdrop, poster, banner, wall blankets, bedspread, picnic blanket, shower curtain, furniture cover, sofa cover, or a creative gift. It's a perfect gift for all age groups, for both indoor and outdoor use. 【Easy to Hang and Clean】 This tapestry is lightweight and easy to hang using decorative tacks, push pins, thumbtacks, or command strips. For cleaning, you can either dry clean or gently hand wash it. Machine washing in cold water is also possible, but do not bleach, iron, or use hard detergent. Hang it to dry. 【Available in Two Sizes】 This tapestry comes in two sizes: 59 x 79 inches and 71 x 91 inches. You can also hang them in combination to create a larger display.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vg1xmwNOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hysenm","source_asin":"B097M3141V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-729460","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097M3141V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097M3141V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
