window.products.push({"id":729783,"name":"Homebrew Guys White Fine Mesh Straining Bags with Sturdy Draw Strings. Pack of 2. Double Stitched Durable Food-Grade Nylon Resists Stains, Odors. Best","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qCIWk9SQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Homebrew Guys Fine Mesh Straining Bags 13.5\" x 23.5\" There are times when you need to strain various foods but don't want any sediment in the final product. Many use cheese cloths or similar, which can do a good job but they tend break down fairly quickly, harbor bacteria and can retain the odor of the last foods used with them. Throw away these cloths! You will be glad you did and will never go back once you use our durable fine mesh straining bags.They are great for your brewing needs as well as being handy in many other situations where food needs to be strained, for example - Making nut milk such as almond milk - Straining yogurt - Straining fruit pulp - Processing cheese With Our Straining bags you get all these benefits: - Hygienic and durable - outlasts cheesecloth - Material does not retain moisture which mean it is much more hygienic when in use with food - Multi use - Brewing, great nut milk bag, coffee and tea strainer - Easy to clean. Air out to dry (do not use dryer), keep away from naked flame and extreme heat. Specifications: * 200 Micron * 13.5\" x 23.5\"  (Please note we also offer the same bags in 10\" x 23.5 size) * Premium Fine Mesh Food-Safe (BPA-Free) Nylon SPECIAL INTRODUCTORY OFFER, LIMITED STOCK. Purchase one for yourself and consider purchasing one to surprise a friend.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qCIWk9SQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homebrew Guys","source_asin":"B07RHTJBPW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-729783","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RHTJBPW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RHTJBPW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
