window.products.push({"id":729867,"name":"Tribello 9 Day Candles, 3 Pack | 7” Red Pillar Candles for Memorial, Love Spell, Novena Prayer, Religious Ceremony, Vigil, Party Décor, Emergency Surv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61q5WdhuceL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Suitable for church altars, shrines & tabernacles but also handy during power outages, outdoor survival  training & emergencies, our 7\" tall red pillar candle is the extra long burning candle you can count on. ⭐ CANDLES FOR MEMORIALS & RELIGIOUS CEREMONIES  Use as Catholic devotional candles, red ritual candles, novena candles or yahrzeit memorial candles.  The red candle jars make them perfect for tabernacle boxes, holy places of worship & prayer rooms. ⭐ CANDLES FOR MANIFESTATION, MEDITATION & MAGIC  Use as decorative red candles for home decor, red candles for spells or red candles for Valentine's Day.  Cast a love spell, decorate altars or conjure up magic using our long burning candles in red plastic jars. Recyclable, fire safe & shatterproof , the red plastic candle jar is safer & more durable than candles in  glass candle containers. Strong, sturdy & stable, our dark red plastic candle jars are less prone to tipping. ✅ Our Candle Burns Over A Week ( Up to 9 DAYS! )  ✅ Non-scented Dye-Free Pure Vegetable Candle Wax  ✅ Candles Sold Individually & in Bulk Value Packs  ✅ Trusted Among Pastors, Priests & Church Clergy  ✅ Extended Burn Time Ideal for Emergency Survival You can use our red 9 day candle indoors or outdoors for everything from camping & backpacking to vigils  & ceremonies. Light a candle in remembrance of a loved one, to attract the love of another or to enjoy the  soothing glow of candlelight. Use them as wedding aisle candles or romantic red candles for your proposal. We here at Tribello take pride in the longevity of our candles. They burn continuously, long, clean & even.  Set the scene with long burn candles in red plastic jars. Click ADD TO CART to order your red jar candles!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61q5WdhuceL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tribello","source_asin":"B08Z6NPVM6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-729867","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z6NPVM6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z6NPVM6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
